{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：14:00 2026-08-31 HKT</p>\n\n<p>《2026年香港小姐競選》於8月30日晚在將軍澳電視城圓滿舉行。12強佳麗經歷數月密集訓練後迎來決賽之夜，最終由1號袁絲珩（Bernice）摘下后冠，8號鄧匡閔（Ada）獲得亞軍；大熱2號李澤欣（Scarlett）則大熱倒灶，遺憾屈居季軍。每逢TVB大型盛事，螢幕前的演出固然精彩，現場花絮往往同樣有看頭。《星島娛樂》直擊當晚實況，為讀者送上第一手趣聞。</p>\n<h2>冠軍袁絲珩人緣不及亞軍？</h2>\n<p>台上公布三甲結果後，台下同樣熱鬧。應屆冠軍袁絲珩的家人在觀眾席開心拍掌，一臉欣慰。頒獎過後，其他佳麗上前祝賀，不過大多數人似乎都圍繞亞軍鄧匡閔擁抱，未見有人特別上前祝賀新科冠軍袁絲珩。一眾落選佳麗其後手拖手返回後台。</p>\n<img alt=\"1號袁絲珩戴上后冠，但其他隹麗擁到亞軍鄧匡閔身旁瘋狂祝賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b65af3df8720c3226a920fac5323ba09/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_06_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁絲珩人緣不及鄧匡閔？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4966236a082c285da6006b8eb33f1e51/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_07_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"冠軍袁絲珩未有得到太大祝賀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26b25584f0e0a48927187d648e059704/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_08_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"冠軍被拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcf1178c2b1deacdcc605ea9bd9e43d9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_07_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"袁絲珩同鄧匡閔，得到佳麗的待遇截然不同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d32b2f35fffabf2ed1cc6e7b2888684/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_07_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"冇人同袁絲珩擁抱祝賀？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/caee380243e52da7bf1aa2c68314444f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_08_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落選港姐走回後台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60ef22812de1408125f560713239fdfd/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_08_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂小姐同鍾培生好好傾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/921e27a559786ed2fc8d12f5d9f835e9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_10_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生一向是「港姐騷忠粉」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0ca243efdcbc0824d9c894ba8f78469d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_10_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一眾落選佳麗見家人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c73d989995b303d98522076182ee774e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_09_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「落選港姐」湯家琳一見家人，即真情流露。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed7275c95f6a9bcfb8668a665b005201/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_08_AM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"見到家人情勢即時產生起伏。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25e243497a5ee45f432ecbcabb44739b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_09_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"攬緊家人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3557cae190591f6b2da122f37fce355/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_10_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"港姐三甲合照環節，冠軍袁絲珩姍姍來遲，亞軍鄧匡閔和季軍李澤欣呆企幾分鐘等候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f52921322bfa29a3c34b53707a2f523f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_11_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"李澄晴奪友誼小姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b966ae98b24a9e302c62ceae5034a414/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_12_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鄧匡閔和李澤欣呆等。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c0a5b91944bca1cbdf31351185a01ae/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_12_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"終於等到冠軍袁絲珩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ff37ef1480a62f99854ecb2dd6fad80/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_12_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"俞可程個手袋好有特色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9278749e7292415df6766ee3760e6bde/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_11_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭柏妍和陳美齡好好傾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/307ee96afe8751f3a1af3a28f827b6d6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_10_AM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《女神配對計劃2》的俞可程、何沛珈、阮嘉敏勁好傾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d9dc165659e60d77baaaf86d1c5f191/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_13_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落選的6號盧蔚晴與5號魏欣「孖公仔」接受訪問，明顯心情愉快。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51c32f58d88a4bc692a60801ede02052/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_13_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盧蔚晴和魏欣擺《龍珠》招牌合體pose，完全放飛自我。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9dcca0d555450e4afe9598f6c08480b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_13_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盧蔚晴接受TVB訪問途中，魏欣順便替娛樂新聞台做Live，「客串」主持了幾分鐘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5fdf9d25d20ca24b870d3ec22153882/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_14_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"魏欣未能進入4強。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d5aaada1e6cb4c8c3156c06e362c14d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_14_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"盧蔚晴和魏欣pose多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/132ff03324e095af4e8f95f9b0599d32/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_14_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>盧蔚晴魏欣落選仍開朗</h2>\n<p>觀眾開始離席之際，有落選港姐的家長走近後台。湯家琳一見家人，即真情流露，上前緊擁。散場時，TVB高層樂易玲（樂小姐）巧遇有「港姐騷忠粉」之稱的「富四代」鍾培生及太太莊雅婷（Angel），雙方寒暄數句。另外不得不提，落選的6號盧蔚晴與5號魏欣「孖公仔」接受訪問，不但毫無失落，更表現得十分開朗愉快。</p>\n<h2>馮盈盈有專人貼身補妝</h2>\n<p>紅地氈環節期間突然下起毛毛細雨，部分藝人唯有冒雨接受訪問，其後一眾嘉賓紛紛走避，轉入一廠與二廠之間的走廊繼續受訪。訪問場上亦不乏趣事，一向愛美的前港姐冠軍馮盈盈，現場有專人貼身補妝；《女神配對計劃2》的俞可程、何沛珈、郭珮文接受訪問時，陳若思與阮嘉敏則在旁等候姊妹。一門之隔的走廊上，補完妝的馮盈盈即「起勢」擺甫士留倩影。Airtime期間，已換上舞衣的宋宛穎一見鏡頭，立刻對鏡舉V拍照，訓練有素可見一斑。</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡華英、刑慧敏、梁凱晴、甘詠寧盛裝行紅地氈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cadee7e8a1d3bb724ea8e8a1440da16d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_24_59_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡華英、刑慧敏、梁凱晴、甘詠寧行紅地毯，當時下起毛毛細雨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43c3246dd00cdd3434e1bf61213eacb7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_00_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《女神配對計劃2》5位「女神」出場，陳若思與阮嘉敏手拖手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5d8985d015ec56380cffde25f6201e2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_00_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何沛珈對鏡頭十分敏感！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a1c3deb5245dba2c0589312be957e0f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_00_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳楨怡影相時，點解謝淑怡會有呢個表情？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adaf71f7d071fcd4369132536d299dc9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_01_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"紅地氈環節完結時，有貴賓搵郭柏妍「集郵」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29422d88261724afca763012c24541cc/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_01_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「魔音女團」的盧映彤（Skylar）（左1）失手露pad。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59dc62486e90a27596043f91ca4d7560/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_01_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落起毛毛雨，藝人舉傘走回室內避雨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92d1bcad785b421aa869ee0c381e8e91/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_02_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落雨要走鬼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4581e31bc483c04170120d09b41c5f2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_02_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"靚女們迫埋一邊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8dfed836493cda1f43382352e9a604f4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_02_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《女神配對計劃2》的俞可程、何沛珈、郭珮文接受訪問時，陳若思與阮嘉敏則在旁等候姊妹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58fd695dd84f839cb6ea9d613523da15/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_03_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭珮文身材勁爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d030f7bb20cc7d074cc44bac60e3b0d8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_03_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"港姐冠軍馮盈盈有專人補妝，專業！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fd7d5f93bf9f2b29f453c8ecf9492a1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_03_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"準備入廠的Gin Lee，對鏡頭一樣敏感，果然是巨星！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e3b7e00ace066b4d81b869741f5aa34/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_04_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"露出可愛一面的馮盈盈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77f6702dd0f4d76b9d6d0f92feb34567/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_04_AM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大會攝影師替馮盈盈影靚相，唔知Instagram幾時有得睇呢？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d295b3d41234658d60ce690fac36ca8f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_04_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擔任旁白的陸浩明。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0710a9ee417288c798e1bd9a2da3e8d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_05_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在後台二廠經過的宋宛穎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b46e3b1e364a01ffc7da52cb4e18870/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_05_AM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"應屆港姐冠軍袁絲珩的家人十分開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bd9cf68a6c9fa661758c9718003093aa/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_06_AM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"表演完後，陳槓怡和郭柏妍手拖手落台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2811f8230bc22dab9ed8dd61ea4db39/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-31_at_11_25_06_AM.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T09:18:41.814225+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":700,"images":45,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}